    <name>Endurance (50min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 5min from 50% to 70% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 56% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 109% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 57% FTP | Steady: 3min @ 80% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 57% FTP | Steady: 32min @ 65% FTP | Cooldown: 4min from 65% to 50% FTP</description>
